  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-rNZbRqCG\" id=\"h490b8bf-adkoLX6Y\">投放位置</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-8FhCTS24\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-ybwrUwuI\"><col data-id=\"c66ad208-HQYLs2Tq\" span=\"1\" width=\"50%\"/><col data-id=\"c66ad208-bNS9dUv6\" span=\"1\" width=\"50%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-mqAK5DAf\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-DX6XDXex\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-FvlINSec\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ojT3mf6Z\">投放版位置</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-cg2vIKVj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4XkQ4KBX\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-fUpmztLz\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-xqfRgOk6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-q7lcW99y\">首选场景</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-QG7mXY5O\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oYMbTYnw\">营销将主要投放在首选场景上，同时为了帮助营销计划更好的跑量和优化成本，系统有可能将营销智能拓展投放到其他流量场景</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-uIYP1jxe\">沉浸式竖版视频场景、信息流场景、视频后贴和尾帧场景</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-5f87qcjm\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-u2pRc1yC\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-THY7Ymqt\">首选媒体</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-RZXN5Aj9\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-z8nhzeNB\">营销将主要投放在首选媒体上，同时为了帮助营销计划更好的跑量和优化成本，系统有可能将营销智能拓展投放到其他流量场景</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-PkFWyXvv\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-kKBZfc6Q\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iwFY1mhu\">通投智选</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-MKX9MHy3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cM46UbHr\">通投智选下，营销会投放到信息流和搜索场景</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-GsNo1zYa\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-ua3iampZ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aLCZQRaJ\">系统优选投放版位</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tc10e1ad-dqiksjfI\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2mNIfEdj\">系统将根据您设置的定向，选择预估效果最好的投放版位进行投放，并触达尽可能多的目标用户</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-VUmox1Fp\" id=\"h490b8bf-t7Z10XoM\">营销目的&amp;首选媒体</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-t