 class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"true\" data-id=\"tc104b89-ONgZh9aQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"880px\" style=\"width: 880px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-TKRiXQ7l\"><col data-id=\"c66ad208-ZvcLj8uZ\" span=\"1\" width=\"440\"/><col data-id=\"c66ad208-G7KlsRdV\" span=\"1\" width=\"440\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-L6OrSVYr\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-uiuvkIL5\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-KDmNyTA8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5CQEhyII\">投放版位置</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-yHF52z95\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QGjECebo\">支持的素材类型</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-4kHSy6As\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-RfKHoQdH\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sMgbvGG2\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">INVENTORY_FEED</code> 头条信息流（营销投放）</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-xJUqsjSt\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-tNnvzOIk\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WdnaRDbh\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_SMALL</code> 小图</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TQrOVe8v\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_LARGE</code> 大图</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cmjyDYhi\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_GROUP</code> 组图</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qjIne4EE\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_VIDEO</code> 横版视频</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ACcdvDC2\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_VIDEO_VERTICAL</code> 竖版视频</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hoHR57Oc\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_LARGE_VERTICAL</code> 大图竖图 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hFW32dGm\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_PLAYABLE_HORIZONTAL</code> 横版试玩素材类型</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GR7WhV8u\"><code style=\"f